    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but my doctor is super hard to reach... like i've left like three messages and haven't heard back. i really need the adderall to function at work though. like if i just take a smaller dose, say half of what i usually take, would that be safe enough to stop the heart racing part? i just need to know if it's actually dangerous or if it's just normal jitters.",
