    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i'm not asking you to be my doctor... i just want to know the actual pharmacology behind it. like, is there even a known interaction between amphetamines and thyroid hormones that would cause a serious issue, or is it just the same side effect happening twice? if i know how they interact, i can make a better decision for myself until i finally hear back from my clinic.",
